  "name": "Trim a Clip",
  "tool_name": null,
  "description": "Cut a clip down to an in and out point. `accurate` re-encodes so the cut lands on the exact frame instead of the nearest keyframe. Runs locally through ffmpeg - no API key and no per-run cost.",
